{"structuredContent":{"schemaVersion":1,"contentId":"document-comparison-v1","facts":{},"blocks":[{"id":"d_ccf4d536dbc8e7dc_0","kind":"prose","nodes":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"变量怎样分到两边？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"在正向运动区间，把速度与时间分别放到两边，才能各自积分。"}]}]},{"id":"d_14f16faeda3a396e_0","kind":"component","type":"comparison","data":{"items":[{"label":"速度变量","detail":"左边只含速度及其微分。","tone":"blue","math":{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"msup","children":[{"tag":"mi","text":"v"},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mo","text":"−"},{"tag":"mn","text":"2"}]}]},{"tag":"mi","text":"d"},{"tag":"mi","text":"v"}]},"mathLabel":"v^{-2}dv"},{"label":"时间变量","detail":"右边只含时间及常数。","tone":"green","math":{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mo","text":"−"},{"tag":"mfrac","children":[{"tag":"mi","text":"k"},{"tag":"mi","text":"m"}]},{"tag":"mi","text":"d"},{"tag":"mi","text":"t"}]},"mathLabel":"-\\frac{k}{m}dt"}]}},{"id":"d_6848d74e9c88eb6a_0","kind":"collapse","summary":"展开检查条件","blocks":[{"id":"d_8552d50570209567_0","kind":"prose","nodes":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"这里使用了速度不为零这一条件。质量与阻力系数保持不变。"}]}]}]},{"id":"d_77f37bda85dfcc76_0","kind":"tabs","items":[{"id":"tab_0","label":"代数检查","blocks":[{"id":"d_022643191fbd267b_0","kind":"prose","nodes":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"把整理后的式子乘回原有因子，确认两边相等。"}]}]}]},{"id":"tab_1","label":"物理检查","blocks":[{"id":"d_a0867a5e23e1f1ea_0","kind":"prose","nodes":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"导数应与阻力导致的减速方向一致。"}]}]}]}]}],"viewVersion":1,"mode":"document","documentVersion":1,"sourceHash":"c9288f469166fc7a","callouts":{}},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 变量怎样分到两边？\n在正向运动区间，把速度与时间分别放到两边，才能各自积分。\n\n\n\n速度变量\nv^{-2}dv\nv^(−2)dv\n左边只含速度及其微分。\n时间变量\n-\\frac{k}{m}dt\n−(k)/(m)dt\n右边只含时间及常数。\n\n展开检查条件\n这里使用了速度不为零这一条件。质量与阻力系数保持不变。\n\n\n\n代数检查\n把整理后的式子乘回原有因子，确认两边相等。\n\n\n\n物理检查\n导数应与阻力导致的减速方向一致。"}]}